stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Rejected: invalid/unauthorized
    Draft --> Validated
    Validated --> Canonicalized
    Canonicalized --> Persisted
    Persisted --> Routed
    Routed --> Available
    Available --> Surfaced
    Surfaced --> Consumed
    Consumed --> Acknowledged
    Rejected --> [*]
    Acknowledged --> [*]
